  "headline": "Amlodipine besylate is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale East has 14.2 days on hand and Corvale General has 24.4 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include amlodipine besylate as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 155 tablets of the 5 mg presentation with a daily use of 10.9 tablets, providing 14.2 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 328 tablets of the 5 mg presentation with a daily use of 13.5 tablets, providing 24.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label fda0739d identifies Zydus Lifesciences Limited (FEI 3005430968) as a registered manufacturing plant with a last inspection classified NAI on 2020-03-09.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same label also identifies Zydus Lifesciences Limited (FEI 3002984011) as a registered manufacturing plant with a last inspection classified VAI on 2022-08-05.",
      "cites": ["E19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA records show multiple inspections of FEI 3002984011 classified OAI (2011-02-03, 2014-09-05, 2019-05-03) and associated Warning Letters on 2011-06-21, 2015-12-23, and 2019-10-29.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E12", "E14", "E16", "E17", "E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to FEI 3005430968 on 2026-06-02.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based alternate manufacturer option ranked 3 is to buy from Ajanta Pharma USA Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
